# a concurrent aspect of the third level is a leaf: a parallel group in it is a compile error (D-081, D-140, D-183)
** spec: semantics/multitasking.md#where-a-group-is-allowed
primary aspect d31_leaf_group is
  process main is
    new r: Integer;
    apply outer(@r);
  return;
end d31_leaf_group;
